WEBVTT

00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:13,580
On social media, I heard someone discuss the need for extra caution in the bathroom when

00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:15,100
flushing.

00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:19,380
Flush three times and clean the toilet after ever use.

00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:24,940
When you've had chemo, so others don't get sick from the chemical, the chemotherapy itself

00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,940
if they're spread of it.

00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:29,060
Do you think that is a concern?

00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:31,380
Well, it is a concern.

00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:35,060
You have a lot of toxic chemicals in you doing chemotherapy.

00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:41,660
You don't, you do want to be careful, you know, you could, it could make someone else not

00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:42,660
feel good.

00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:49,980
They're not going to get enough of it to cause ill health, I wouldn't be so concerned

00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:50,980
about that.

00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:56,620
But if you had little children around, yeah, you'd want to be more cleanly than that.

00:00:56,620 --> 00:01:02,780
I have never really addressed this subject because I thought that you would have gotten information

00:01:02,780 --> 00:01:05,940
from the oncologist about things like this.

00:01:05,940 --> 00:01:10,740
So I've never really investigated more than, I think I've had a couple people ask this question

00:01:10,740 --> 00:01:13,260
before, but we'd never really posted anything on it.

